  "bodyHash": "184befcf8156fd54",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a> | <a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252ffaq\" rel=\"nofollow\">FAQ</a> | <a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fcredits\" rel=\"nofollow\">製作人員</a></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一款適用於 Minecraft 的鄰近語音聊天模組，提供多種附加元件 (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252faddons\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加元件</a>)，帶來更多額外功能與特性。</p>\n<p>⚠️&nbsp;<strong>注意</strong>&nbsp;此模組需要在伺服器端進行特殊設定才能運作。請閱讀 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki%252fsetup\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a> 以獲取更多資訊。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4dH2zwTmyX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_54aa599e-dca8-4985-ab3b-0c7eea6b093a.png\" width=\"300\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>如有任何問題，歡迎加入我們的 Discord 伺服器！</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>下載</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-game-version=2020709689:10150\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/simple-voice-chat/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bukkit/Spigot/Paper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:9153\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsimple-voice-chat%252fversions%253fl%253dvelocity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Velocity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsimple-voice-chat%252fversions%253fl%253dbungeecord\" rel=\"nofollow\">BungeeCord/Waterfall</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>按鍵通話</li>\n<li>語音啟動</li>\n<li>鄰近語音聊天</li>\n<li>密碼保護的群組</li>\n<li>自動語音活動偵測</li>\n<li>自動麥克風增益調整</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopus-codec.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Opus 編解碼器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjmvalin.ca%252fdemo%252frnnoise%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">RNNoise</a>&nbsp;循環神經網路降噪技術</li>\n<li>OpenAL 音效</li>\n<li>支援 Fabric、NeoForge、Forge、Quilt、Bukkit、Spigot 與 Paper 之間的跨平台相容性</li>\n<li>支援 Velocity、BungeeCord 與 Waterfall</li>\n<li>相容於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>（建議使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClothConfig</a> 以獲得更佳的設定介面）</li>\n<li>可自訂按鍵通話按鍵</li>\n<li>麥克風與喇叭測試播放</li>\n<li>可自訂語音距離</li>\n<li>低聲耳語</li>\n<li>個別玩家音量調整</li>\n<li>麥克風擴音</li>\n<li>3D 音效</li>\n<li>AES 加密</li>\n<li>支援分離音軌的錄音功能</li>\n<li>強大的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fapi\" rel=\"nofollow\">API</a></li>\n<li>豐富的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252faddons\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加元件</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">想要架設運行 Simple Voice Chat 的伺服器嗎？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.bloom.host%252faff.php%253faff%253d2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://bloom.host/assets/images/Comp_2.gif\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">在此 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.bloom.host%252faff.php%253faff%253d2\" rel=\"nofollow\">租用</a> 您自己的語音聊天伺服器</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">更多關於如何設定的詳細資訊，請見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.bloom.host%252fmultiplatform%252fsimple-voice-chat%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2>圖示說明</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>圖示</th>\n<th>說明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_f97b8585-e83d-497c-99f5-392cbc0ec617.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>你正在說話</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_ce0aca93-3f5d-4780-af3c-ea67cacd2818.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>你正在低語</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_abb579d2-93c9-4b58-98fe-3af74640b927.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>玩家正在說話</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_dbf0ec2c-2894-467f-a12b-783562b3d270.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>玩家正在低語</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_5c00868a-8177-4285-a834-f7f6182750f3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>麥克風靜音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_8ad963e4-d2c9-48ce-bbc5-86a560107b52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>語音聊天已停用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_61dd79be-18cf-4c2a-b062-01a95f2b2159.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>語音聊天未連線<br>語音聊天尚未安裝</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>圖形使用者介面 (GUI)</h2>\n<p>按下 <code>V</code> 鍵即可開啟語音聊天 GUI。透過此介面，您可以進入設定、群組聊天、靜音自己、停用語音聊天、開始/停止錄音以及隱藏所有圖示。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_c2a9809c-f4df-41a0-a0d2-dcf05ce9a32a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<h3>群組聊天</h3>\n<p>群組聊天功能讓您可以與非鄰近範圍的玩家進行對話。要開啟群組聊天介面，可以在語音聊天 GUI 中點擊群組按鈕，或直接按下 <code>group</code> 鍵。</p>\n<p>要建立新群組，只需在文字欄位輸入名稱並按下底部的按鈕即可。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_d5f9b725-c5d3-4f21-84d9-4c2666f8cdce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p>建立或加入群組後，將進入群組聊天介面。您還會在螢幕左上角看到群組成員的頭像。正在說話的玩家頭像會帶有外框標示。您可以點擊左數第三個按鈕來隱藏這些圖示。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_e7b80129-1beb-4e61-ac59-53b45831481c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p>未加入群組的玩家會在您的頭像旁邊看到一個群組圖示，表示您處於群組聊天狀態。</p>\n<p>您可以透過輸入指令 <code>/voicechat invite &lt;playername&gt;</code> 或在社交互動畫面中邀請玩家加入您的群組聊天。</p>\n<h3>設定</h3>\n<p>按下 <code>V</code> 鍵並點擊設定按鈕即可存取語音聊天設定。</p>\n<p>此選單提供設定語音聊天音效選項的功能。</p>\n<p>點擊麥克風按鈕可以測試語音啟動功能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_70d113bb-2d0e-4851-8098-1b63d97c81ce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<h2>重要注意事項</h2>\n<p>您需要在伺服器上開啟一個連接埠。預設為 <code>24454</code> <code>UDP</code> 連接埠。若不開啟此連接埠，語音聊天將無法運作。此連接埠可在伺服器設定檔中修改。更多資訊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki%252fsetup\" rel=\"nofollow\">請見這裡</a>。</p>\n<p>語音聊天資料已進行加密，但我們不保證其安全性。請自行承擔風險使用！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
